lama-nl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/llama-nl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-29T06:39:50Z","updated_at":"2024-12-29T06:41:04Z","body":"> The background for the Android native boot splash is the same as the Adaptive Icon background, which is Godot's icon background by default. To customize this, set the `Adaptive Icon Background` in the export settings to a PNG with a solid color of your choice.\n\nYes, you are right. It fix the problem.  Few more things, when I give `launcher_icons/adaptive_foreground_432x432` it changes the application icon and ignore the `Main Icon`. I want to make my icon apear like godot apk.\nexample:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d7cc269-f9b2-4951-aaa9-ffa43fff98d0)\nA solid colored bg and main icon top of the bg","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564630286/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564634070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100513#issuecomment-2564634070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100513","id":2564634070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y3TXW","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-29T07:02:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-29T07:10:57Z","body":"> Few more things, when I give launcher_icons/adaptive_foreground_432x432 it changes the application icon and ignore the Main Icon\n\nIt is intentional. Fallback chain for Adaptive Icon Foreground `Provided foreground icon -> Provided main icon -> Project icon -> Default Godot foreground icon.`\n\nFor Icon like the Godot Editor, set a adaptive foreground icon and a solid color background icon. For Instructions and related links, see https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/export/exporting_for_android.html#providing-launcher-icons\n\n@llama-nl Keep this issue open, as we need to document that the Android native splash background and icon are the same as the Adaptive background and icon.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564634070/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]